<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Good evening, Keyran fam!

Today I bring you the perfect unreportable macro so you can bot all night without problems. You won't be reported because you will never have the fatigue level high enough so that other players can report you.

So, first, a few things to consider:
1) Please try the macro first, because there are a series of mouse movements and clicks, so you will need to have the time dimension bombs in the right place.
2) Your settings should be Full Window for Digimon and 1366 x 768 for your computer.
3) This macro will get you to Minato City. Keep in mind that I haven't unlocked every map on the game, so check if the first clicks open the Time dimension bomb menu correctly, and then the cursor hovers over Tokyo-Odaiba, and then over Minato City. If it does, great! If it doesn't, please correct it yourself by editing the cursors movement coordenates.

Now, on to the Macro itself:

You will be transported to Minato City, and then you will be moved to the Gesomon Area. I tried this macro a few times, and realized that you will not always appear on the same place. Thus, the macro may or may not leave you on the Gesomon area, or it may leave you in a place where you won't kill a Gesomon every second. Nonetheless, you are guaranteed to farm some exp. Please note that you won't be using skills for this macro, just a normal attack. I recommend having a high level digi (116+) with good HT, or just change the macro so that you use skills.

You will be training for 1 hour, and then you will go back to dats center and rest for 15 minutes so your fatigue levels go back to zero.

Good luck, hope this macro is useful to y'all!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
